## Source Code?

Here’s what I can reveal:

- This tool runs on **Lua 5.2**.
- The `"lang"` file is actually a renamed `lua52.exe`, which runs the code.
- The `"api"` file contains all the Lua 5.2 libraries — like `math`, `string`, `coroutine`, `print`, etc.
- The `"code"` file contains the actual program logic. It's sensitive, so I had to encode it.

I understand you may be curious to see the Lua code behind this tool. If you're genuinely interested in learning (not stealing), feel free to message me on Facebook or DM me on Discord — I might share the decoded version.
